Liduo Wang is a professor of the Department of Chemistry at Tsinghua University. He received his PhD degree from Nagoya University of Japan in 1995. Dr. Wang has once worked as a visiting scholar in the Department of Chemistry and as a research associate in the Department of Electrical and Electronic Engineering at Hong Kong University of Science and Technology, and as a postdoctoral researcher in the Department of Materials Science and Engineering, Tsinghua University. His current research interests include perovskite solar cells, organic-inorganic semiconductor multilayer, and its optoelectronic properties.
